OrangeIslands_Moro_GhostShip_Room_B1F_Text_VossIntro::
	.string "CAPTAIN VOSS, of the MORO.\p"
	.string "I logged every soul who boarded\n"
	.string "this ship. I will log you.\l"
	.string "But not before a battle.$"

OrangeIslands_Moro_GhostShip_Room_B1F_Text_VossDefeat::
	.string "...Struck. Properly struck,\n"
	.string "for the first time.$"

OrangeIslands_Moro_GhostShip_Room_B1F_Text_VossPostBattle::
	.string "Take the log, then. It's no use\n"
	.string "to a man who can't put in.\p"
	.string "And take the warning with it:\n"
	.string "the hold below is open water,\l"
	.string "and the MORO draws deep. What\l"
	.string "sank her is down there still.$"

OrangeIslands_Moro_GhostShip_Room_B1F_Text_VossRepeat::
	.string "The hold is below. Go down, and\n"
	.string "keep going down.\p"
	.string "Whatever is under the MORO has\n"
	.string "had twenty years to settle in.$"

OrangeIslands_Moro_GhostShip_Room_B1F_Text_ReceivedHM08::
	.string "{PLAYER} received HM08\n"
	.string "from CAPTAIN VOSS.$"

OrangeIslands_Moro_GhostShip_Room_B1F_Text_ExplainHM08::
	.string "HM08 is DIVE. A POKEMON that\n"
	.string "knows it will take you under\l"
	.string "deep water, and bring you up\l"
	.string "again.\p"
	.string "Start with my hold. I never\n"
	.string "could.$"

OrangeIslands_Moro_GhostShip_Room_B1F_Text_VossNoRoom::
	.string "Your BAG is full. Come back for\n"
	.string "it -- I'm not going anywhere.$"
